criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
PAF cumulative scores above the cut-off: values of T > 60; 
fluent written and spoken German
Exclusion criteria:
acute suicidality; 
acute endangerment to others;
acute self-injury; 
Addictive disorders (current addictive disorder or substance abuse); 
Regular use of benzodiazepines; 
bipolar disorder (current or past episodes); 
Acute psychotic symptoms within or outside of a depressive episode; 
Schizophrenia spectrum disorder (current or past); 
Current psychotherapeutic treatment
Psychopharmacology: Stable intake of at least 4 weeks prior to study participation
